<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<lab name="Enterprise_EIGRP_Advanced_Routing_Lab" version="1" scripttimeout="300" lock="0" author="Rahul">
  <description>Enterprise multi-branch network implementation using Cisco EIGRP routing protocol. This lab demonstrates advanced EIGRP features including MD5 authentication, route summarization, route leaking, and route filtering.</description>
  <body>1. Configure EIGRP AS 100 across all routers.
2. Establish EIGRP neighbor relationships.
3. Implement EIGRP MD5 authentication.
4. Configure EIGRP manual route summarization.
5. Implement EIGRP route leaking using leak-map.
6. Configure route filtering using prefix-list and distribute-list.
7. Verify routing tables and end-to-end connectivity.</body>
